Zero point energy                ...      0.11461257 Eh      71.92 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00434051 Eh       2.72 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
